  "description": "Astera’s Wireless PixelBar is a linear wash fixture with built-in battery pack. Each of its LEDs can be individually addressed and offers ultra-high color rendering, digital color calibration and a native 21° beam. Thanks to its smart stands, hanging bracket, connectable endcaps and the integrated airline track it can be quickly assembled in numerous ways and is suitable for a wide variety of applications such as concert/touring, corporate events, TV etc.\n\nThe PixelBar is available in 1m (16 x 10 W LEDs) and 50cm (8 x 10 W LEDs).",
